Bring in "sys" as sys.
Bring in "math" as math.

Note: Sentinel Pro v0.9.8 - Safety and Expressions.

Print "Sentinel Pro is initializing...".

List files in "." as my_files.
For each f in my_files:
    Set file_size to the size of f.
    
    If file_size is greater than 1000000:
        Set warning to f joined with " is a large file.".
        Print warning.
        Move f to "Large_Files/".
    Otherwise:
        Print f joined with " is small, skipping.".

Print "System organization is complete.".
